.scratch/
# Run evidence stays out of git. Each verdict's page in testdata/ quotes
# what the run produced.
testdata/*.json
testdata/*.png
testdata/*.log
# The witnesses are the exception (#946). A run's output is what the run made; a
# witness is what a person saw, signed, and the checks open it: --verify for the
# dev lane and --verify-g0 for the driver lane. A record one machine keeps proves
# nothing once the machine is gone, so this line is what lets the copy be committed.
!testdata/*-witness.json
tools/observer/.gradle/
tools/observer/build/
